id=a52sxq_devicestate
name=Galaxy A52s 5G non-foldable device state
author=kusti420
description=The source services.jar hardcodes Samsung's foldable device-state machine: DeviceStateManagerService always builds FlexibleDeviceStatePolicy/Provider with the six fold states and the AOSP default provider was stripped. Without a folding sensor the provider settles on CLOSED, whose properties make WindowManager, CameraServiceProxy, AOD and apps treat the phone as a folded foldable. Hand the provider a single property-less DEFAULT state instead, like AOSP does on non-foldables.
